  "infoModal": {
    "about": "About this tool",
    "setting": "About search settings",
    "close": "Close",
    "text1": "This tool is designed for exploring decks for defense exams and magical assault practice.",
    "text2": "Based on the input levels, it exhaustively searches all possible decks and displays the optimal results.",
    "text3": "As all processing is done on the device,",
    "text4": "it can be very time-consuming.Characters that are unlikely to be used (such as SR or R) should have their level set to 0 to exclude them from the search.",
    "text5": "Since all cards are calculated with maximum enhancement, please consider the results as a rough estimate.",
    "text6": "Also, the damage dealt is selected from the highest two among M1, M2, and M3; therefore, it is often not possible to achieve both healing or evasion and high damage.",
    "text7": "Self 3T buffs and ally buffs are not considered, so you can deal more damage in some combinations.",
    "text8": "The sort setting sorts the results by the specified key. ",
    "text9": "The minimum value setting will not add decks with values below the specified value to the search results. Since this leads to improved processing speed, please set a value that can eliminate values that are not considered.",
    "text10": "The maximum number of results sets the display limit, which affects the sorting speed of the search results, so it is better not to increase it unnecessarily for faster processing.",
    "text11": "The 'No Buddy' result indicates the number of characters without an HP buddy.",
    "text12": "If you want to create a deck with an HP buddy for everyone in magical assault practice, it is recommended to set the sort order to ascending for sort key 1.",
    "text13": "The Edit button is used when you want to temporarily change a character's stats. After making changes, the calculations will use the new values when starting an exploration, but the original values will be restored upon refreshing the screen."
  },
